Description:
    Adds Noticed-driven Mixin message notifications: ensures the `noticed`
    gem is in the Gemfile and scaffolds one example notification delivered
    through MixinBot's Mixin channel (`deliver_by :mixin`) over the HTTP
    message API.

Example:
    rails generate mixin_bot:notifications

    This will create:
        app/notifications/payment_received_notification.rb

    It will also ensure `noticed` is present in the Gemfile.
